@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor Black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor LightBlue

title Diagrama de Sequência - Registro de Propriedade

actor "Usuário" as User
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "BFF Gateway" as BFF
participant "Orchestrator" as Orch
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "Queue Worker" as QW
participant "Offchain Consumer" as OC
participant "Blockchain (Besu)" as BC
participant "Event Listener" as EL

User -> FE: Preenche formulário de registro
FE -> BFF: POST /api/properties/register\n{matriculaId, proprietario, ...}
BFF -> Orch: Proxy: POST /properties/register\n+ JWT validation

Orch -> Orch: Validar dados de entrada
Orch -> DB: Verificar se matricula existe
DB --> Orch: Not found

Orch -> DB: INSERT property\nstatus = PENDENTE
DB --> Orch: Property ID created

Orch -> MQ: Publish REGISTER_PROPERTY job\n{propertyId, matriculaId, ...}
Orch -> DB: UPDATE status = PROCESSANDO_REGISTRO
Orch --> BFF: 201 Created {propertyId}
BFF --> FE: Property registration initiated
FE --> User: Aguardando aprovações...

MQ --> QW: Consume REGISTER_PROPERTY job
QW -> OC: POST /api/properties/register\n{matriculaId, beneficiary, ...}

OC -> OC: Build transaction
OC -> BC: requestPropertyRegistration(matricula, beneficiary)
BC --> OC: TX Hash: 0xabc...
OC --> QW: {requestHash, txHash}

BC -> BC: Mine transaction
BC -> BC: Emit RegistrationRequested event\n{requestHash, matricula, beneficiary}

BC --> EL: Event detected
EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/blockchain/properties/\nregistration-requested\n{requestHash, matriculaId, txHash}
Orch -> DB: UPDATE property\nrequest_hash, blockchain_tx_hash
Orch --> EL: 200 OK

== Fase de Aprovações ==

User -> FE: Instituição Financeira aprova
FE -> BFF: POST /api/properties/{id}/approve
BFF -> Orch: POST /properties/{id}/approve
Orch -> MQ: Publish APPROVE_REGISTRATION job
MQ --> QW: Consume job
QW -> OC: POST /api/properties/approve\n{requestHash, institution: FINANCIAL}
OC -> BC: approveRegistrationAsFinancial(requestHash)
BC -> BC: Emit RegistrationApproved\n{requestHash, "FINANCIAL", approver}
BC --> EL: Event detected
EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../registration-approved
Orch -> DB: Record approval 1/3
Orch --> EL: 200 OK

note over BC: Repete para Cartório (2/3)\ne Prefeitura (3/3)

BC -> BC: 3ª aprovação recebida\n**Auto-execução**: mint(beneficiary, matricula)
BC -> BC: Emit RegistrationExecuted\n{requestHash, matricula, beneficiary}

BC --> EL: Event detected
EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../registration-executed\n{requestHash, matriculaId, beneficiary}
Orch -> DB: UPDATE property\nstatus = OK
Orch -> DB: UPDATE ownership
Orch --> EL: 200 OK

note over FE: Frontend polling ou WebSocket

FE -> BFF: GET /api/properties/{id}
BFF -> Orch: GET /properties/{id}
Orch -> DB: SELECT property
DB --> Orch: {status: OK, ...}
Orch --> BFF: Property data
BFF --> FE: Property registered ✅
FE --> User: Propriedade registrada com sucesso!

@enduml
